### @Autowired
Auto dependency injection by type
```java
@Autowired
private UserRepository repo;
```

### @Qualifier
Resolves ambiguity when multiple beans of same type exist
```java
@Autowired
@Qualifier("mysqlRepo")
private UserRepository repo;
```

### @Primary
Marks default bean when multiple candidates exist
```java
@Primary
@Component
public class MySQLRepo implements UserRepository { }
```

### @ControllerAdvice
Global exception handler
```java
@ControllerAdvice
public class GlobalExceptionHandler {
    @ExceptionHandler(ResourceNotFoundException.class)
    public ResponseEntity<?> handleNotFound(Exception ex) {
        return new ResponseEntity<>(ex.getMessage(), HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND);
    }
}
```

### @ResponseStatus
```java
@ResponseStatus(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND)
public class ResourceNotFoundException extends Exception { }
```

**Best Practice:** Centralized error handling with meaningful HTTP status codes

### @RequestBody
Binds HTTP request body to Java object (JSON → Object)
```java
@PostMapping("/users")
public User createUser(@RequestBody User user) {
    return userService.save(user);
}
```

### @ResponseBody
Converts Java object to HTTP response body (Object → JSON)
```java
@ResponseBody
@GetMapping("/users/{id}")
public User getUser(@PathVariable Long id) {
    return userService.findById(id);
}
```

**Note:** @RestController = @Controller + @ResponseBody combined

@Transactional manages database transactions automatically.

### Usage:
```java
@Transactional
public void transferMoney(Long from, Long to, Double amount) {
    accountService.debit(from, amount);
    accountService.credit(to, amount);
    // If any fails, both rollback
}
```

### Properties:
- **propagation**: REQUIRED, REQUIRES_NEW, etc.
- **isolation**: READ_COMMITTED, SERIALIZABLE, etc.
- **rollbackFor**: Which exceptions trigger rollback
- **readOnly**: Optimization for read operations

**Default:** Rolls back on RuntimeException only (not checked exceptions)

The dependency array controls **when** useEffect runs:

### No array (omitted)
```js
useEffect(() => { /* runs on every render */ });
```

### Empty array `[]`
```js
useEffect(() => { /* runs once on mount */ }, []);
```

### With dependencies
```js
useEffect(() => { /* runs when count changes */ }, [count]);
```

**Cleanup**: Return function runs on unmount
```js
useEffect(() => {
    const timer = setInterval(...);
    return () => clearInterval(timer); // cleanup
}, []);
```

